     "body": "<p>Created a PR: <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo4-vagrant/pull/10\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo4-vagrant/pull/10</a></p>\n\n<p>Would need to create a new release in fcrepo-webapp-plus with:<br/>\nfcrepo-webapp-plus-rbacl-audit-FEDORA_VERSION.war<br/>\nfcrepo-webapp-plus-rbacl-FEDORA_VERSION.war<br/>\nfcrepo-webapp-plus-audit-FEDORA_VERSION.war</p>\n\n<p>And then update the FEDORA_TAG in the config file here.</p>",
